Package: dsSupportClient
Type: Package
Title: Descriptive Functions for 'DataSHIELD'
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sofia", "Siampani", email = "SofiaMaria.Siampani@mdc-berlin.de", role = "aut"),
    person("Florian", "Schwarz", email = "Florian.Schwarz@dife.de", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1088-4773")))
License: GPL-3
Description: Convenience functions for analysts working with 'DataSHIELD',
    which analyses data held on separate servers without the data leaving
    them. It provides summaries of many variables at once, and batches of
    tables and histograms across studies, built on the aggregate functions
    of 'dsBaseClient'.
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.0.0)
